<Base title="Learn — Kogen" description="Build and ship real applications with coding agents in Vibe Coding for Adults, a practical course by Almir Sarajčić.">
  <main id="main" class="wrap">
    <article class="prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Learn</p>
      <h1>Build and ship with coding agents.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Vibe Coding for Adults is Almir Sarajčić’s practical course on building real applications with coding agents.</p>
      <p>If you already use a coding agent and want a more repeatable way to build, check and ship your work, follow the process through a real application.</p>
      <h2>Build the platform behind the course</h2>
      <p>The course platform itself is the running example. Follow the work from a feature request through implementation, tests, independent review and deployment. See how workflows, tool interfaces and persistent agent sessions fit into delivering and improving an application.</p>
      <p>Apply the methods to your own projects with the agents and setup you use. Kogen appears as one practical tool for shaping and delivering features.</p>
      <h2>Explore Vibe Coding for Adults</h2>
      <p>Visit the course website to see what’s covered, how the course works and how to join.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="https://vibecodingforadults.com/">Explore Vibe Coding for Adults <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>
